  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Customer/Client)\n\n### Capium 365: How to add Customers invoices\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 29 Jul, 2025 at 11:46 AM\n\n\t\tBelow is the step- by- step Guide to add customers into the capium 365\n\nNavigation: Capium 365 > Client Portal > Invoices >Customers\n\nCustomers\n\nWhen you click on Invoices, you’ll be taken to the main Invoices page. From here, you can select Customers, upon selecting customers \n\nAdding Customers:\n\nFirst click onto '+add Customers' in there \n\nUpon clicking on Add Customers\n\nOnce you've selected or added a customer, please ensure all relevant information is filled in accurately:\n\nCustomer ID\n\nAccount Name\n\nPayment Account\n\nVAT Rate\n\nContact Details \n\nAddress Details \n\nAfter entering all the required details, click Save to update the customer profile.\n\nBy this you can add customer into Capium 365\n\nWant an overview of Invoices and other Areas with that? \n\nFor a more detailed guide on how to add or bulk upload invoices, please see the help article below: \n\nhttps://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000268872?portalId=9000044273\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
